'''Crazed Tank Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] unlocked by completing the event stage [[Absolute Defense (Insane)|The Crazed Tank]] appearing on the '''6th''' of every month. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] increases her health and speed. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], you can get her from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] after completing Cosmic Club in Ch. 3 Interstellar Invasion. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!|The Battle Cats Unite]], the stage to obtain her appears every '''Monday'''.

